{"id":"n82837-11-7","stage":5,"title":"팔아먹다 · 购入","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82837-11-7-1","ko":"이보게, 나 돈 좀 빌려주게나.","zh":"老兄，借我点钱吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이보게,","meaning":"表示“人”。；看、听我说（이보게 用来招呼对方、引起注意）","explanation":"이：表示“人”。；보다：看、听我说（이보게 用来招呼对方、引起注意）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71124","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빌려주게나.","meaning":"借；给予，给","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：给予，给；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；게나：向平辈或晚辈发出较缓和的劝告、请求。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"表示“人”。","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71124","definition":"表示“人”。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看、听我说（이보게 用来招呼对方、引起注意）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"看、听我说（이보게 用来招呼对方、引起注意）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/682fe9b890d475818533.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82837-11-7-2","ko":"이 사람아, 나도 쌀을 됫박으로 팔아먹는 주제인데 무슨 돈이 있겠나?","zh":"我连买米都是一小斗一小斗地买，哪还有钱啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"指代“这个人”。","explanation":"이：指代“这个人”。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"3","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람아,","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"7","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌀을","meaning":"米，大米","explanation":"쌀：米，大米；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"쌀","audio":"/audio/409668b14ff6c36e6073.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62094","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됫박으로","meaning":"量米斗、小斗","explanation":"됫박：量米斗、小斗；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"됫박","audio":"/audio/509b8356f4e9943f6b85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:됫박:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"됫박","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"팔아먹는","meaning":"买粮食吃（本句不是“卖掉”）","explanation":"팔아먹다 在这里采用词典第 11 义“花钱购买粮食”；쌀을 됫박으로 팔아먹다 指一小斗一小斗地买米吃，强调手头拮据。","readings":[{"term":"팔아먹다","audio":"/audio/5088d2fb064067f44dd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82837","senseId":"11","lemma":"팔아먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주제인데","meaning":"主题","explanation":"주제：主题；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"주제","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91771","senseId":"1","lemma":"주제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠나?","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"指代“这个人”。","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代“这个人”。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"指或称呼亲近的对方的时候使用的词语。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1098bbe